---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base>
  <section class="hero">
    <canvas id="hero-canvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <div class="hero-wash" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <a href="/" class="mark" aria-label="Oyster Genomics"><span>OG</span></a>
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <h1 class="hero-title">The ocean feeds billions. We’re upgrading the operating system.</h1>
      <p class="hero-lede">
        Land agriculture figured this out decades ago: giant monopolies weren’t built on better
        tractors&#8288;—&#8288;they were built on owning the code. From Monsanto to Ohalo Genetics bypassing
        millions of years of plant evolution, terrestrial ag has spent fifty years engineering
        massive, compounding yield gains.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <main>
    <section class="band">
      <p>
        Meanwhile, aquaculture&#8288;—&#8288;the fastest-growing animal protein sector on
        earth&#8288;—&#8288;is still largely farming wild genetics and hoping for calm seas.
      </p>
      <p class="band-stand">That changes with OG.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="band">
      <p>
        We aren't just running damage control on coastal die-offs. Our Switchpoint platform treats
        the marine genome as programmable architecture&#8288;—&#8288;merging precision editing, multi-omics, and
        machine learning to compress biological growth timelines, erase disease vulnerabilities, and
        double down on biomass accumulation.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="band band-yields">
      <p>Fewer resources.</p>
      <p>Fractions of the harvest cycle.</p>
      <p>Unstoppable yields.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="band band-close">
      <p>We cracked the code for marine protein. The ocean is just our canvas.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer class="site-footer">
    <a href="mailto:jeff@oystergenomics.com" aria-label="Email Jeff at Oyster Genomics">
      Contact <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a>
  </footer>
</Base>

<script>
  import { startHero } from "../scripts/hero-canvas.js";
  startHero();
</script>
